@Strategy $MSTR raised $602.8M selling common stock last week, per this morning's 8-K. $369.7M of it bought Bitcoin, 4,603 coins added to total 845,050.

$151.8M bought back the company's own preferred stock, $STRC. Another $50.7M paid $STRC's dividends and $30M went to cash.

